sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Protect as protect middleware
    participant IsAdmin as isAdmin middleware
    participant Router as groupRoutes.js
    participant DB as MongoDB Group and User

    Client->>Protect: POST /api/groups/ name, description, Bearer token
    Protect->>Protect: jwt.verify(token, JWT_SECRET)
    Protect->>DB: User.findById(decoded.id) select minus password
    DB-->>Protect: user
    Protect->>Protect: req.user = user
    Protect->>IsAdmin: next()

    alt req.user.isAdmin is true
        IsAdmin->>Router: next()
        Router->>DB: Group.create name, description, admin, members
        DB-->>Router: group
        Router->>DB: Group.findById(group._id) populate admin and members
        DB-->>Router: populatedGroup
        Router-->>Client: 201 populatedGroup
    else Not an admin
        IsAdmin-->>Client: 403 Not authorized admin only
    end

    Note over Protect,Client: If token missing or invalid, protect returns 401 Not authorized
